From: Ilya I. Nikitin <ilya.i.nikitin@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] msm8916-wcd: declare the speaker mono

The speaker mixer routes RX1 to the single RX3 speaker DAC. Advertising
stereo playback silently discards the right channel. Declare one playback
channel so audio servers downmix stereo sources before sending them to
the codec.

---
--- a/ucm2/codecs/msm8916-wcd/Speaker.conf
+++ b/ucm2/codecs/msm8916-wcd/Speaker.conf
@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@
 
 	Value {
 		PlaybackPCM "${var:WcdPlaybackPCM}"
-		PlaybackChannels 2
+		PlaybackChannels 1
 		PlaybackPriority 200
 	}
 }
